# Zemin paneli (REQUIRED)

Canonical panel ground matches the page header card
(`rounded-2xl border border-dark-500/50 bg-dark-800/70 shadow-card` → remapped to `--glass-bg`).

## Token (source of truth)

- CSS class: `.app-surface-panel`
- JS constant: `APP_SURFACE_PANEL_CLASS` from `src/utils/dashboardDesign.js`
- Form sections: `FormSectionPanel` / `FORM_SECTION_PANEL_*_CLASS` (already wired)

## When the user says “zemin paneli ekle” / “panel ekle”

Always use:

```jsx
import { APP_SURFACE_PANEL_CLASS } from '../utils/dashboardDesign'

<section className={`${APP_SURFACE_PANEL_CLASS} p-4`}>…</section>
```

Or `FormSectionPanel` for titled form blocks.

Do **not** invent new frosted whites (`glass-inset` alone, `bg-white`, ad-hoc rgba) for page/section panels.

## Do not

- Hardcode a different panel fill per page
- Use bare `glass-inset` as the outer section chrome (use `app-surface-panel` / FormSectionPanel)
